Exception, not covered by the licence above:

  UnityProject/Assets/VolumetricClouds/LightHalo.shader
  UnityProject/Assets/VolumetricClouds/LightHaloDynamic.shader
  UnityProject/Assets/VolumetricClouds/FogLamps.shader, only the blink table (kBlink)
    and the blink and switch-on lines of its first pass's vertex shader

The first two files are hand-written ports of Cities: Skylines' own light halo shader
(Custom/Lights/GroupVolume, both its batched and instanced variants), reconstructed for
interoperability with the game. The lines of FogLamps.shader named above are copied from
LightHalo.shader; the rest of that file is covered by the licence above. The same applies
to the compiled form of all three in VolumetricClouds/Resources/volumetricclouds.bundle,
and so in the built VolumetricClouds.dll, which embeds it. The original shader is the work
of Colossal Order Ltd., who hold whatever rights attach to it. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
